        "density": 0.01808,
        "chars": 401,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 40.2
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        159,
        1415,
        2003,
        1783
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "If it appears that the inquiry may result in disciplinary proceedings based on the employee's answers to questions or on his refusal to answer, an exact stenographic record of the questioning of the employee should be made. In cases of refusal to answer, the Corporation Counsel should be consulted to ensure that proper procedures are followed in connection with any subsequent questioning and in connection with any disciplinary proceeding based on such refusal.",
