      "category": "Text",
      "text": "If the employee's answers or his failure to answer or appear before a superior officer, the Department of Investigation, or before any other authorized body, court or officer, are to be made the basis of his discharge or other disciplinary penalty, formal charges must then be brought, a disciplinary hearing held, and the procedure set forth in Section 75 of the Civil Service Law carefully followed.",
